WEBVTT

00:12:29.263 --> 00:12:30.763
They asked us to record

00:12:30.797 --> 00:12:33.263
our own version
of Jimmy Kimmel's Mean Tweets.

00:12:33.997 --> 00:12:36.197
We took the worst feedback
we'd ever received

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.097
on student course evaluations,

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.730
and we read it out loud.

00:12:40.197 --> 00:12:44.163
Angela Duckworth: “It was easily one of 
the worst three classes I’ve ever taken...

00:12:44.197 --> 00:12:48.163
one of which the professor
was let go after the semester.”

00:12:48.863 --> 00:12:51.197
Mohamed El-Erian: “The number of 
stories you tell

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:53.763
give ‘Aesop’s Fables’ a run for its money.

00:12:53.763 --> 00:12:55.163
Less can be more.”

00:12:55.763 --> 00:12:56.930
Ouch.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.763
Adam Grant: “You’re so nervous

00:12:58.763 --> 00:13:01.530
you’re causing us
to physically shake in our seats.”